      "contentDigest": "1acad6cff9d10580705dc746deb4c34fafcc3de9ea181b6650a68ce8b9e4448d",
      "review": {"status": "approved", "approvedDigest": "1acad6cff9d10580705dc746deb4c34fafcc3de9ea181b6650a68ce8b9e4448d", "by": "project-editor", "reference": "docs/reviews/2026-09-14-fool-s00-s09-narrative-audio.md"}
    },
    {
      "id": "klein-s09-story-02",
      "kind": "story",
      "title": "第二章 · 灵摆之外的核验",
      "text": "在廷根，他把占卜从神秘的仪式变成耐心的工作。灵摆给出倾向，书页留下线索，现实负责最后的核验。一个占卜家真正依靠的，不是漂亮的预言，而是知道什么时候仍然不能下结论。",
      "sourceKind": "interpretation",
      "evidenceRefs": [
        {"path": "pathways/fool/canon.json", "sha256": "a7fc2fb3c1bbb7a752bf500451147e07518e557c81389304790b2a0ae285bf6a", "locator": "fool.s09 相关能力、扮演原则与限制断言"},
